</div>
</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Grant’s net worth is estimated at around <strong>$82.33m</strong>, taken from his <strong>$205.83m</strong> in career earnings. Players Bio publishes <strong>$20m</strong> for him, which is under a tenth of what he has been paid in salary alone.</p>
<p>He played two seasons at Syracuse and <a href="/teams/philadelphia-76ers/">Philadelphia</a> took him 39th in 2014, three months after he turned 20. His father and his uncle both played in the league before him.</p>

