<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/jerami-grant/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/jerami-grant/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is Jerami Grant’s 2026-27 Salary?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Grant earns $34.21m in 2026-27, the largest salary at Memphis by some way. It rises from $32m at Portland last season. His career earnings reach $205.83m across thirteen seasons. The salary is 28.38% of the club’s $120.55m payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Jerami Grant Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"One season remains after this one, a player option worth about $36.41m with a deadline of June 29, 2027. He turns 34 that March."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Jerami Grant Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $34.21m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"When Does Jerami Grant’s Contract Expire?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Grant is in the fourth year of a five-year contract worth $160m that he signed with Portland in 2023 under Bird rights, fully guaranteed. Memphis took the contract on this summer. The last season is a player option with a deadline of June 29, 2027, and he would reach free agency in 2028 at 34."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Jerami Grant’s Net Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Grant’s net worth is estimated at around $82.33m, taken from his $205.83m in career earnings. Players Bio publishes $20m for him, which is under a tenth of what he has been paid in salary alone. He played two seasons at Syracuse and Philadelphia took him 39th in 2014, three months after he turned 20. His father and his uncle both played in the league before him."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Is Jerami Grant Paid $34.21m?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Grant is paid $34.21m because a forward who scores and defends across positions is the most expensive thing in the league outside a star, and he has been paid at that level since 2020. He has earned $205.83m in career salary after being taken 39th."}}]}</script>
